<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sold 97.16 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sold 97.16 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 97.16 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 43.85 million rand on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>The Bond Exchange was closed on Wednesday for the New Year's Day holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
